1) New helper in pageAgent:
```js
function outlineOf(cs) {
  const st = cs.outlineStyle;
  if (!st || st === 'none' || st === 'hidden') return null;
  const w = parseFloat(cs.outlineWidth) || 0;
  const col = parseColor(cs.outlineColor);
